<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - USF&amp;G Corp said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - USF&amp;G Corp said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney raised its rating on USF&amp;G Corp to buy from neutral, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/4 to 18-1/4.</p>
</text>
